sg:b20 a sg:Battle ; rdfs:label "南郡之战" ; sg:storyYear "209" ; sg:outcome "诸葛亮一气周瑜，取荆州" ; sg:occursAt sg:pl38 .
sg:b20 owl:sameAs sg:南郡之战 .
sg:b21 a sg:Battle ; rdfs:label "合肥之战（逍遥津）" ; sg:storyYear "215" ; sg:outcome "张辽威震逍遥津，孙权败" ; sg:occursAt sg:pl45 , sg:pl46 .
