sg:e47 a sg:Event ; rdfs:label "空城計" ; sg:storyYear "228" ; sg:inChapter sg:ch95 ; sg:placeName "西城" ; sg:description "司馬懿大軍壓境，諸葛亮大開城門，焚香撫琴，司馬懿疑有伏兵而退。" ; sg:virtual true .
sg:e48 a sg:Event ; rdfs:label "五丈原" ; sg:storyYear "234" ; sg:inChapter sg:ch104 ; sg:placeName "五丈原" ; sg:description "諸葛亮第六次北伐，與司馬懿相持於五丈原，積勞成疾，星落秋風。" ; sg:virtual false .
sg:e49 a sg:Event ; rdfs:label "高平陵之變" ; sg:storyYear "249" ; sg:inChapter sg:ch107 ; sg:placeName "洛陽" ; sg:description "司馬懿趁曹爽陪帝謁陵，發動政變，誅曹爽集團，魏政盡歸司馬氏。" ; sg:virtual false .
sg:e50 a sg:Event ; rdfs:label "鄧艾滅蜀" ; sg:storyYear "263" ; sg:inChapter sg:ch117 ; sg:placeName "成都" ; sg:description "鄧艾偷渡陰平，直取成都，劉禪出降；姜維詐降鍾會，事敗而死。" ; sg:virtual false .
