sg:variant11 a sg:VariantReading ; rdfs:label "第84回 夷陵之戰" ; sg:inChapter sg:ch84 ; sg:description "「七百里」為小說誇張，嘉靖本較簡。" .
sg:variant12 a sg:VariantReading ; rdfs:label "第95回 空城計" ; sg:inChapter sg:ch95 ; sg:description "毛本增設琴聲、掃地等細節，戲劇性更強。" .
sg:variant13 a sg:VariantReading ; rdfs:label "第104回 五丈原" ; sg:inChapter sg:ch104 ; sg:description "禳星情節為毛本增飾。" .
sg:variant14 a sg:VariantReading ; rdfs:label "第120回 結尾" ; sg:inChapter sg:ch120 ; sg:description "兩版結局一致，毛本附加總結詩。" .

